{
 "description": "Requires a ChainHelix API key as bearer token, or 2 cents per call paid over Binance b402 in USDT, USDC, USD1 or U on BNB Smart Chain, or over x402 in USDC on the Base network. The instrument lane signals (paper book, BNB Chain venue) newest first, each with its commit status in the CHXI attestation stream: seq, hash, opBNB transaction. Optional instrument id and limit (default 50, max 500). A signal without a seq was written before the stream started or is not yet committed",
